WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.450
Dhalsim falls after the prerequisite Arm punch follow-up.

2
00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:02.900
Heavy Pillar and heavy Shoulder produce the automatic Justice Beyond club strike.

3
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:03.500
Held heavy-kick Indomitable Defense begins while Dhalsim is still crumpling.

4
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.500
The heavy-punch Moral Breakdown follow-up extends the Pillar conversion.

5
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.200
Level 2 spends two Super bars after the stance follow-up.

6
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.000
Instant Oblivion completes the demonstrated extension.
